s available and none was invoked.\n- The proposed replacement candidate for the intended record verified cleanly, providing the correct FORM-DSH-1 linkage that the supplied certificate lacked.\n\n**Bottom line:** The supplied certificate is internally valid but does **not** match the intended record's identity (wrong form: FORM-DSH-2 vs. intended FORM-DSH-1). I proposed and verified the correct FORM-DSH-1 candidate with value 7 under the mandated session/execution metadata.",
